.TH HEALTHPROBE 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
healthprobe \- Probe a Kingdom service's /health endpoint by port or URL; exit 0 when healthy.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B healthprobe
<port|url>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Probe a Kingdom service's /health endpoint by port or URL; exit 0 when healthy.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXIT STATUS
Exit codes: 0 healthy, 1 unhealthy or unreachable, 2 usage.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
healthprobe 19100
healthprobe https://127.0.0.1:19006/health
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
